on unTaint (s) {
	«Any text coming from outside that does not pass through mainResponder.neuterMacros and that may be displayed in a page should pass through here. All { characters are translated to &#123; and all } characters are translated to &#123;. This prevents unwanted macros expansion, means the text is safe.
		«10/30/99; 4:36:45 PM by PBS
		«Changes:
			«11/1/99; 5:42:54 PM by PBS
				«No need to replace } characters.
	
	s = string.replaceAll (s, "{", "&#123;");
	«s = string.replaceAll (s, "}", "&#125;") //PBS 11/1/99: this is superfluous
	
	return (s)}